    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for unified CUDA/HIP error handling and recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Converts CUDA/HIP error codes to <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1a3a571daf696b6722a5ea7e8c31ce39be" kindref="member">GPUErrorClass</ref> taxonomy, logs diagnostics, and invokes recovery policy. Thread-safe; protected by internal mutex for concurrent stream access.</para>
<para><heading level="3">Usage</heading>
</para>
<para><bold>Direct error handling</bold>: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>handler<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_error_handler_1a7c9d8442a62fa478274c9ec00bae691c" kindref="member">GPUErrorHandler::Create</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="gpu__error_8h_1a00a732ab4048fd2446773b198c3e7a9d" kindref="member">cudaError_t</ref><sp/>err<sp/>=<sp/>cudaMalloc(&amp;ptr,<sp/>size);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(err<sp/>!=<sp/><ref refid="gpu__error_8h_1a3b2ae102ff50ab2803f6670e8f73895b" kindref="member">cudaSuccess</ref>)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>handler-&gt;handleError(err,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;cudaMalloc&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>logs<sp/>+<sp/>applies<sp/>policy</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><bold>Macro-based (recommended)</bold>: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="gpu__error_8h_1acc7879c81144836818b034332fa0e352" kindref="member">CHECKED_CUDA</ref>(cudaMalloc(&amp;ptr,<sp/>size));<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>auto-logs;<sp/>throws<sp/>on<sp/>critical</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
